NOTE: The data set WORK.X has 1 observations and 0 variables.

1695       proc mcmc data=x outpost=simout seed=1234 nmc=1000 nbi=200;
1696       ods select TADpanel;
1697       parm alpha 0.3;
1698       lp = logpdf('normalmix', alpha, 3, 0.3, 0.4, 0.3, -3, 2, 10, 2, 1, 4);
1699       prior alpha ~ general(lp);
1700       model general(0);
1701       run;

NOTE: Tuning the proposal distribution.
